flowchart LR
    U[Student User]
    UI[Web UI]
    A[Auth API]
    GH[GitHub OAuth + GraphQL]
    RS[(Redis)]
    Q[BullMQ Queue]
    W[Sync Worker]
    N[Normalizer]
    AC[Anti-Cheat Engine]
    SE[Scoring Engine]
    RE[Rank and Tier Engine]
    DB[(MongoDB)]
    API[Leaderboard and Profile APIs]

    U --> UI
    UI --> A
    A --> DB

    UI -->|Connect GitHub| GH
    GH -->|OAuth callback| A
    A -->|Store state and cache| RS

    UI -->|Request sync| API
    API -->|Cooldown check| DB
    API -->|Enqueue job| Q
    Q --> W

    W -->|Invalidate and read cache| RS
    W -->|Fetch metadata| GH
    W --> N
    N --> AC
    AC --> SE
    SE --> RE

    RE -->|Update score/rank/tier| DB
    SE -->|Score breakdown| DB
    AC -->|Flags| DB

    UI -->|Read leaderboard and profile| API
    API --> DB
    API --> UI
